            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\n> ... but it would be nice to get a better looking one with icons, etc ...\r\n\r\nI am not sure which icons are we talking about? I'd assume all entries would have the same icon. Do you have something else in mind?\r\n\r\n> ... which would also available for those who do not have `mini.sessions` installed.\r\n\r\nAgain, not really sure how that would work. The whole idea of 'mini.sessions' is that it stores sessions at particular paths which it knows about. Without it, how would potential `MiniExtra.pickers.session` know where to look for session files (and how the look, even)?\r\n\r\n> Specifically, for my intended use case, I wanted to use custom mappings for `mini.sessions` to invoke `MiniSessions.delete` from the picker itself.\r\n\r\nThat is somewhat already possible with `MiniSessions.select()` as it [takes `action` argument](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/964fab7fecd14f66a69a96162f8aa816480690fd/doc/mini-sessions.txt#L207) to perform when choosing a session.",
